  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{d} \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{B}}=\\frac{\\mu_0 \\mathrm{di}}{2 \\pi \\mathrm{R}}[-\\cos \\theta \\hat{\\mathbf{i}}-\\sin \\theta \\hat{\\mathbf{j}}]$\n$\\mathrm{di}=\\frac{\\mathrm{T}}{\\pi \\mathrm{R}} \\mathrm{Rd} \\theta$\n$=\\frac{\\mathrm{I}}{\\pi} \\mathrm{d} \\theta$\n$\\mathrm{d} \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{B}}=\\frac{\\mu_0 \\mathrm{I}}{2 \\pi^2 \\mathrm{R}}(-\\cos \\theta \\hat{\\mathrm{i}}-\\sin \\theta \\hat{\\mathrm{j}})$\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/SyHEmVJgNZqITAbkm-sBP3cSg41b1bPxLkPjiXq61Og.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n$\\vec{B}=-\\frac{\\mu_0 I}{\\pi^2 R} \\hat{j}$",
